. *数据预处理
. **生成人均观鸟时长
. gen BTN=BT/BN
(543 missing values generated)

. **PI缺失值替换为0
. replace PI = 0 if missing(PI)
(22,273 real changes made)

. **剔除控制变量存在缺失的样本
. drop if missing(Temp, Wind, PD, BTN, CO2, Water, Green, Farm, Grass)
(2,372 observations deleted)

. **王老师装机规模换算成面积
. gen Area = ICtotal*1000/0.15

. replace Area = Area / 1000000
(17,048 real changes made)

. label var Area "集中式光伏电站面积平方千米"

. **取对数
. gen Pop=ln(PD)

. gen Duration=ln(BTN+1)

. gen Carbon=ln(CO2)

. gen PM=ln(PM25)
